Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:09.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What could this man\Npossibly need from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:12.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted today\Nand I want to go home now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:16.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, what did you want me to join you for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:20.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,For a mock battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,A-a mock battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:26.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think I've had a training partner\Nsince I went to those schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I may not seem like it,\Nbut I'm quite famous in the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Choose whatever you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.71,0:00:37.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let me see what\Nyou're truly capable of, Mr. Hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.13,0:00:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a godsend for a budding adventurer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.79,0:00:47.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, let's start our battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know how much of a challenge\NI'll be for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.54,0:02:28.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I'll take this as a chance to train\Nwith someone more skillful than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.54,0:02:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,A mock battle with Captain Gilbert?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.67,0:02:34.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who even is that guy?\NHope he enjoys the afterlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.83,0:02:37.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Such polished movement,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.88,0:02:53.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,and the way he controls\Nhis pace is impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.46,0:02:57.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,He had to have trained like crazy\Nto get himself to this level.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.13,0:02:59.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:01.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,why's he so slow?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:04.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.33,0:03:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,With me as his opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:09.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,he sees no point in showing\Neven a glimpse of what he can really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:11.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Time out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.29,0:03:13.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.50,0:03:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know you're taking it easy on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.42,0:03:18.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,but you don't have\Nto hold back that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.29,0:03:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.75,0:03:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Was I taking it down a notch\Nbecause he's a normal human?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.50,0:03:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.54,0:03:34.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's much faster than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.13,0:03:36.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, more importantly...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,the moment I evade him,\Nhe leaves himself completely open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's like he's luring me in...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:47.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.88,0:03:50.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why won't my spear touch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.21,0:03:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, this is a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.88,0:03:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think he's seriously fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:59.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Damn... Try this on for size!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.08,0:04:04.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,He changed it up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.33,0:04:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can still handle more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.92,0:04:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can speed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.54,0:04:22.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Could it be that...\Nhe's already giving it all he's got?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.04,0:04:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,After all that solitary training I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:34.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I might actually be getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then even I... could maybe wi-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragrave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:01.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay. This one's my loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:11.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,How could anyone\Nevade the captain's Dragrave?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,He was using a practice spear\Nwith a wide tip
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,so the wind force sent that guy flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:22.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,If it was a battle spear,\Nhe would have lost his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.63,0:05:27.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,People with talent like Captain Gilbert\Nare one in a million.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.79,0:05:30.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Talent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.71,0:05:35.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I noticed I had a gift for this\Nthe moment I held a spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.17,0:05:39.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gilbert is the winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.67,0:05:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's the guy they talk about\Nin the royal capital...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.67,0:05:46.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The difference in their power\Nis clear as day.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:49.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no one in this village\Nthat can beat that guy anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:52.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The more I trained,\Nthe more polished my technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:55.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,and the more strength I'd gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.04,0:05:57.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.88,0:06:07.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy yourself in our village?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. That was painfully boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.50,0:06:14.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hear you go around to various areas\Nsearching for the strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.88,0:06:19.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I don't think there's anyone\Naround here that can match you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.79,0:06:23.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I've beaten every worthy opponent\Nin the royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.21,0:06:27.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I left there with high hopes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:32.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,According to the rumors,\Nthe balance of power between the kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.17,0:06:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,and their foreign neighbors is falling apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.88,0:06:37.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right now, those countries\Nare calling for strong troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:41.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and those troops will gather\Nin search of fortune and fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.63,0:06:45.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should go home\Nand see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Return to the capital\Nthat is assembling its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.21,0:06:57.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I returned to the royal capital and\Nsingle-mindedly continued hunting demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.96,0:07:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I heard someone formidable\Nhad joined the corps,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.42,0:07:05.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I challenged them to fights,\Nand I thoroughly trounced them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.17,0:07:08.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,This isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is there no one who can give me\Na real challenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.33,0:07:19.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every fiber of my being is bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:26.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am surrounded by weaklings!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.83,0:07:31.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,So this is where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.25,0:07:39.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're looking glum for someone who's had\Nthe honorable alias of "Spear Sovereign"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:40.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,bestowed upon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.75,0:07:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just another bothersome title\Nthrust upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't realize a title equal to my\NSword Sovereign rank was such a burden.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.21,0:07:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.00,0:07:54.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of all these chumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.75,0:07:56.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,What about Ines?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:07:58.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ines?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's like, she's strong\Nin a different way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:06.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But in a simple mock battle,\NI'd come out on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:09.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It'd be so much more interesting
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.08,0:08:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,if there were more competent people\Nlike you, Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.88,0:08:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:17.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That does sound amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.42,0:08:19.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must be bored too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.92,0:08:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Training soldiers and adventurers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.83,0:08:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,who hardly equal the power\Nof one of your pinkies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.46,0:08:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,In any case, I am to protect\Nthe royal capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:30.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't win a war by myself,\Nno matter how strong I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.88,0:08:32.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.08,0:08:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,someday, there will appear someone\Nwho will surpass me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:38.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someday, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.75,0:08:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope they show up\Nwhile I'm still in this position.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:46.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I might keel over from boredom first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:51.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,A man who defeated a minotaur\Nall on his own...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:55.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to know what kind of person\Ncould do that, but he makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:09:00.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He showed not one ounce of interest\Nin the most lavish of rewards,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:03.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,and he was so discourteous,\Neven in audience with the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.75,0:09:05.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought he was all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.29,0:09:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.54,0:09:11.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,it didn't feel like he had the power\Nto kill that monster at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.88,0:09:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why won't my spear touch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can still handle more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.54,0:09:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can speed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.79,0:09:33.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:35.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.75,0:09:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm coming at you full-force, as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.54,0:09:45.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Much faster than the speed of sound,\Nand my most powerful technique-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:49.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I knew that if I let something like that\Nloose on a person they'd die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.83,0:09:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was the only way I could make him\Nfeel my spear in that moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:57.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dragrave!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I had no idea what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.54,0:10:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,For the first time in a head-on battle,\NI was thoroughly defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.33,0:10:15.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Furthermore...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.50,0:10:17.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I give up. I've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.63,0:10:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.58,0:10:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.13,0:10:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's no point in continuing to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:27.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Was he showing concern for me because\Nwe were in front of my subordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd never been so humiliated.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:32.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? What is it that you "get"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.75,0:10:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.67,0:10:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've fought plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:39.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Moreover, those words he said as he left...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I look forward to\Nmeeting up with you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.83,0:10:58.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are those cracks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.67,0:11:00.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,When did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.21,0:11:04.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have no idea how he did that...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.79,0:11:07.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Regardless, he evaded my technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.04,0:11:10.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,and he did it while I was at full strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.96,0:11:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks like things are\Nfinally going to get exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:21.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,But jeez, that was an amazing attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:27.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,There I was,\Nthinking I was becoming stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.33,0:11:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,but even after using Physical Enhancement\Nand Featherstep to avoid it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.96,0:11:39.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,If he hadn't held back just enough\Nso that I could get away,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd be dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:46.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,He went out of his way to warn me\Nthat pride will lead to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That Al-something...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, Gil...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.96,0:11:53.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure it was something-"bird."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.50,0:11:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bird...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:56.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Filbird?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.83,0:12:00.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That can't be right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.63,0:12:02.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful he did all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.88,0:12:04.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm still weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:08.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to toughen up even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.08,0:12:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.29,0:12:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is shockingly good\Nat getting that mud out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It even gets the stubborn stuff\Nstuck at the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:29.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,This sword really is great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:31.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, he sure made quick work of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:33.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't he? He does such a wonderful job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just like Lynne's dad said,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.96,0:12:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,even if you're a little rough with it,\Nit won't get a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.83,0:12:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, it was pretty shabby when I got it,\Nso maybe I'm just not paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.67,0:12:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:47.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you take care of mine next?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.00,0:12:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:13:00.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm glad my ditch clearing job\Nis going well, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:05.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that I've had to stop\Nmy soil hauling job for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Since I can only take F-rank jobs,\Nif work in the royal capital dries up,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.67,0:13:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,there'll be entire days\Nwhere I have nothing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:16.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that I've got this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I may as well use it to try to be useful\Nto people or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:23.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could use this as an oar...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, I'd have to buy a boat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.42,0:13:29.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,And it costs money to rent an oven.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.58,0:13:30.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,As long as I have the space to do it,\NI can use it as a griddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:37.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But... the problem is the fire power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.46,0:13:38.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tiny Flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.79,0:13:44.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,With my abilities, the best I can do\Nis light my fingertip about this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.88,0:13:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even though I trained\Nso much at those schools,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.92,0:13:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could only acquire skills\Nof the lowest level.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.38,0:13:58.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Noor, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:13:59.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lynne...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:03.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You are not permitted to take on\Nsuch a familiar manner as you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.29,0:14:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,..burg, my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:08.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just call me Lynne.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.08,0:14:10.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did someone say something\Nto you about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:13.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, no. Anyways, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry for just showing up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.38,0:14:18.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I asked the guildmaster where you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.21,0:14:19.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I bothering you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:20.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.88,0:14:23.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell him the exact location though...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.33,0:14:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,she can find out where\Nother people are using her skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:30.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why are you here to see me again?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.38,0:14:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, I have a special request\Nto ask of you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want you to accept me as your page.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What even is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.63,0:14:41.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.46,0:14:44.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,A page is someone who takes care\Nof your everyday necessities,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.75,0:14:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,as they learn techniques\Nand absorb knowledge from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:51.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I had to say, it's somewhat close\Nto an assistant, or having an apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.21,0:14:54.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just allowing me\Nto be around you is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I will cause you no trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:59.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,so if you could please let me-
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.21,0:15:00.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:00.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.88,0:15:04.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-then, there was something\Nyou were unhappy with from the other day?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.83,0:15:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps, you think someone\Nas young as I would be unreliable?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.75,0:15:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.71,0:15:14.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you let me stay,\NI'm sure I can be of use to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:15.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I may not look it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:18.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I've achieved the highest marks ever\Nin all six training schools!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:19.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,That isn't the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.92,0:15:24.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's nothing at all that I can teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.58,0:15:29.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think you can help me,\Nbecause I can do what I need to on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.54,0:15:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-then my family will\Npay you a handsome instructor's fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.42,0:15:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I don't need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.83,0:15:40.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,In that case, you can use me\Nto do whatever you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,As an assistant for requests from\Nthe adventurer's guild, or for odd jobs,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:44.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,anything at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.00,0:15:45.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't need you to do that either.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:46.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just don't have a need for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.21,0:15:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes to show you\NI can be of help to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:16:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope this will make you believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.63,0:16:03.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now, pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.13,0:16:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Icicle Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.00,0:16:11.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hellflare!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.04,0:16:20.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is one of the highest levels\Nof magic skills that I can use.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.17,0:16:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's called Hellflare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.88,0:16:24.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mist Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:44.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is a secret of the thief class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Sovereign of Shadows,\NInstructor Carew,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:47.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,was kind enough to impart\Nthis knowledge unto me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.67,0:16:48.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And also...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.21,0:16:55.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Divine Slash!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:06.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What I just showed you is the sacred-class\Nskill of a swordsman, Divine Slash.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.71,0:17:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's a highly specialized technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.58,0:17:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,especially effective against the undead,\Nand also-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.88,0:17:12.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get it. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:15.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Th-then do I have permission\Nto become the page of-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.29,0:17:16.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.04,0:17:19.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is she doing all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.79,0:17:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It seems she's mistaken me for\Na person who's worth learning from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,After seeing everything she just did,\NI understand her talents well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.83,0:17:30.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I almost feel pitiful compared to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.17,0:17:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's become more and more obvious\Nthere's nothing I can teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.63,0:17:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:40.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But my power has been recognized\Nby the Six Sovereigns,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.04,0:17:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,and if you let me join you,\NI'm sure I can assist you in some way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.71,0:17:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I still think I'm nothing compared to you,\Nbut I beg of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.75,0:17:51.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,How can I make her understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.58,0:17:54.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's best\Nto just show her the reality...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.33,0:17:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Earlier, you showed me\Na lot of amazing skills you have,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.79,0:18:01.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I'll show you my own skills now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.50,0:18:02.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tiny Flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.25,0:18:12.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The young boy with no talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.83,0:18:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The instructors at the royal capital's\Ntraining schools would tell stories
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.46,0:18:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,of this young boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:26.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,However, everyone interpreted them\Nas fairy tales, created to teach lessons.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:32.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because the idea of that\Nyoung boy was preposterous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:34.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,As a twelve-year-old,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.92,0:18:36.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,he attended all six training courses
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.88,0:18:40.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,known for their rigorous nature\Nat the royal schools,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,and completed the full term for each.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.42,0:18:45.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That sort of person cannot possibly exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.58,0:18:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone knows that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The brawniest warrior would give up
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:54.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,after three days in that three-month\Nlong course, let alone a child...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.13,0:18:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought the same thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.75,0:18:59.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,until I met that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.75,0:19:03.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Oken\Nshowed me something once.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.25,0:19:07.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What interesting thing\Ndo you have to show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lady Lynneburg, have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.83,0:19:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Tiny Flame got bigger!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:18.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.08,0:19:20.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Interesting, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.33,0:19:23.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Depending on the training,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:26.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,even the base level skill\NTiny Flame can grow this large.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It has absolutely no practical use,\Nand for me who has lived
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,more than 200 years and has some time\Non his hands, it's just a bit of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.17,0:19:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tiny Flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.17,0:19:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I tried countless times\Nto do it myself too,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.29,0:19:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't make the flame\Neven slightly larger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.83,0:19:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is not something\Nthat could be done in a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,but it requires devotion to your studies\Nfor a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.96,0:19:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that's precisely why\NI was stunned speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.21,0:20:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was many times bigger than what the\Nworld's greatest sorcerer Oken had done.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.38,0:20:03.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,A Tiny Flame\Nthat far outclassed the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:06.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is my Tiny Flame.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.79,0:20:10.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The other five class skills\Nare just like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.21,0:20:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you understand what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.33,0:20:18.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Basically, all six of his class skills\Nare extraordinary.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.33,0:20:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What did I just show to that\Nmonumentally powerful person?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just showing off some high-level skills\Nthat I've only memorized?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:31.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,He repelled those attacks from that Minotaur's axe
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:33.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,with only a single broadsword\Nin his hands numerous times.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,He didn't brag about his power and\Nquietly went on working for other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.83,0:20:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I could put it into one word,\NI'd say he's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.75,0:20:44.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not only in body, but in mind as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.00,0:20:48.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,He has the fortitude\Nto live life on his own,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.75,0:20:50.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,so he will never yield to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.63,0:20:56.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,In the future, I will be in the position\Nto lead this kingdom alongside my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.79,0:21:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The motto of the Clays royal family is\N"Those of royal blood must be strong."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.29,0:21:07.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's why more than anything I must learn\Nhow to achieve strength like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:20.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the meal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.08,0:21:27.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Noor. I've figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.13,0:21:31.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,My own pride, as well as my immaturity.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.42,0:21:37.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Until the day comes when\Nyou will recognize me as your page...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.42,0:21:42.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Until that happens, I will follow\Nbehind you wherever you may go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.92,0:21:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lord Noor. No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.54,0:21:46.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:49.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Instructor"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.50,0:21:51.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because the answer\Nthat I am in pursuit of...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.50,0:21:54.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,no, the supreme "strength"\Nthat generations upon generations
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,of the Clays royal family have sought
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:21:59.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,resides within this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.54,0:22:03.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,How... did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.04,0:22:11.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,#3 I Parry Taking on a Page
